        "app_name": "Elemental Smash",
        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "**Elemental Smash** is an exhilarating arcade game that tests your reflexes, strategy, and precision across five unique levels—three available now and two coming soon. Each level offers a distinct elemental challenge to keep you engaged.  \n\nIn *Space Squash*, play in a hexagonal arena with honeycomb-patterned walls. Hit the ball against the walls to score, but missing three times ends the game. Fast reflexes are essential!  \n\n*Frost Frenzy* ups the intensity with ice cannons firing in twelve directions. Equipped with an ice baseball bat, you must react to glowing indicators and sound cues to hit incoming ice balls. Avoid getting hit three times as the pace ramps up.  \n\n*Magma Meltdown* heats things up with lava minions charging your way. Use two hammers to strike a drum, generating force fields to eliminate enemies. Smaller minions are fast and require one hit, while medium and large ones demand two or three, respectively.  \n\nWith two more levels on the horizon, *Elemental Smash* promises action, strategy, and endless fun. Prepare for dynamic gameplay and intense challenges as you master the elements!",
